.git
# Load-bearing: a host .venv here would overlay the image's /app/.venv.
.venv
# Patterns without `**` only match at the top level, so the nested ones matter: ui/node_modules is
# built on the host (macOS binaries) and would otherwise be copied over the Linux tree that the
# image's own `npm ci` layer installs.
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
test-results/
playwright-report/
